SUMMARY:Week 2026-19 - Hyrox Engine Intro
DESCRIPTION:PURPOSE: Establish compromised running baseline. First exposure to run-SkiErg alternation under fatigue.\n\nWARM-UP 10 min: 5 min easy jog HR < 130\, leg swings x10 each\, hip circles x10 each direction\, 2x20m high knees\, 2x20m butt kicks\, 2x20m A-skips.\n\nMAIN SET — 4 rounds\, 2 min easy walk/jog rest:\n  RUN 800m @ 10K effort (approx 4:55–5:10/km). Not a sprint. Tall posture\, cadence >170 spm\, breathe rhythmically. Relax upper body.\n  IMMEDIATELY into SKIERG 500m: Hinge from hips on pull\, hands drive to hip level\, arms float back to eye height with relaxed elbows. Stroke rate 22–26 spm. Target pace sub-2:05/500m. Do not rush the recovery.\n  Round target: complete each round within 10 sec of round 1 split. Log every split.\n\nCOOL-DOWN 10 min: 5 min easy jog\, hip flexor kneeling lunge 60 sec each side\, 8 deep diaphragmatic breaths in 90/90 position.\n\nKPI: Round splits within 10 sec of each other. HR recovers below 145 within rest window. Form holds across all 4 rounds.
