SUMMARY:Week 2026-19 - Run Z2 + Strides
DESCRIPTION:PURPOSE: Active aerobic maintenance. Reinforce easy running economy with neuromuscular strides.\n\nWARM-UP 10 min: 5 min easy jog HR < 135\, leg swings x10 each leg\, high knees 2x20m\, butt kicks 2x20m\, A-skips 2x20m.\n\nMAIN SET — 40 min Z2: HR cap 135–150 strict. Target pace 5:40–6:10/km flat terrain. HR is the governor — not pace. If HR drifts above 150 before reaching target pace\, slow immediately. Breathe nasally — if you must open your mouth you are going too hard. Check posture every 10 min: tall\, slight lean from ankles\, relaxed shoulders.\n\nSTRIDES — 6x20 sec: 85% controlled fast — not a sprint. Tall posture\, quick ground contact\, relaxed jaw\, arms drive back without crossing midline. 60 sec walk/jog full recovery between each.\n\nCOOL-DOWN 5 min: Easy jog fading to walk. 5 deep diaphragmatic breaths.\n\nKPI: Avg HR below 148. No cardiac drift in final 15 min. Pace-HR ratio stable. Log avg HR and avg pace.
