DESCRIPTION:MOBILITY 15 min: Prioritise areas that were tight or sore this week. Minimum: hip flexors 60 sec each side\, hamstrings 60 sec each side\, calves 45 sec each side\, thoracic extension over roller 60 sec.
WEEKLY REVIEW - complete the WEEKLY_REVIEW template fully:
  1. Sessions completed vs planned (%)
  2. Biggest win of the week
  3. Biggest miss - what was the root cause?
  4. One behavior change with highest impact next week
